s=7f20f&oh=00_AQG0ednOefAKgGIMcEOQSb4AeCr2zTFDr3fzcMFqL8zK1A&oe=6A95DB0F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_L.png", "id": "743822133471845", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974686_743822136805178_638669774767115236_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MzxX1D3Az94Q7kNvwE1W1CM&_nc_oc=Adp7heGDuzeli9WpZFrBRbIqcDGCMvfvVlKgCGz3LtWjREIMDcgNVb3yC60nHw2MCiQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHjqN-8Ql7DsiyFAPdFeoG5iNrYyyIlhpiqd-mtKx64Mg&oe=6A95D6AE"}, "display_name": "RoomGolf VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "How about playing golf in your room?\n\nNo difficult operations!\nThe operation has been made as simple as possible.\nBecause you can play leisurely\nRecommended for VR beginners.\nJust decide the direction and the height of the hit ball, pull the ball and release it!\nWe have prepared a fairway, rough, bunker and pond in the room.\n\nYou can enjoy all 18 holes + special halls.\n\n\nFREE PLAY MODE\nYou can challenge as many times as you like in each hole.\nPlease challenge to achieve all hole birdies.\n\nCHAMPIONSHIP MODE\nRound 9 holes and get honor and crown with total score!\n\nSPECIAL HALL\nOnly those who have won a certain number of crowns\nWe have a special hole for you to play.\nPlease try it!", "short_description": "How about playing golf in your room?\n\nNo difficult operations!\nThe operation has been made as simple as possible.\nBecause you can play leisurely\nRecommended for VR beginners.\nJust decide the direction and the height of the hit ball, pull the ball and release it!\nWe have prepared a fairway, rough, bunker and pond in the room.\n\nYou can enjoy all 18 holes + special halls."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.dream-jack.com/index_roomgolf_vr.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DreamJack,Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.dream-ja